# Guitar Freaks 2nd Mix (GQ883 VER. KAA), Konami 1999: as gtrfrk2m-play.his (another CD: the game
# starts from flash at once after its install, no power-cycle), from what gtrfrk2mka-install left. Power-on
# boots from flash: FLASH-ROM CHECK, then attract. Two coins (one credit), then Start through the
# caution screen, How To Play, the mode select (NORMAL) and the music select (its default, GO GO
# AGAIN). The first stage is played with the guitar map: every 12 frames a neck chord (R, G, B, R+G,
# G+B, R+B, open) is held and picked, a wail every 240 frames. Some versions end the stage when the
# excite gauge runs out, others play the song to its result (STAGE FAILED, ~frame 13800); then GAME
# OVER. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game gtrfrk2mka

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 6600 press "Coin 1" 8
at 6650 press "Coin 1" 8
at 7000 press "1 Player Start" 8   # title: start
at 7300 press "1 Player Start" 8   # caution screen
at 7600 press "1 Player Start" 8   # How To Play
at 7900 press "1 Player Start" 8   # mode select: NORMAL
at 8200 press "1 Player Start" 8   # music select: GO GO AGAIN

# the first stage
at 8400 press "P1 Button R" 8
at 8402 press "P1 Pick" 3
at 8412 press "P1 Button G" 8
